From 693d0242c2283dcd7ceb5ad0b333801d20c2a3fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forklift <forklift@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:00:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] forklift: per-keyframe trace (FORKLIFT_SLAM_TRACE) and
 the patch identification line

Process-wide trace object (no karto class changes layout): per processed keyframe the
lock wait, the time under the lock, scan match, AddEdges (LinkNearChains), the near-linked
BFS (nodes, edges, scans), FindPossibleLoopClosure (ids visited, chains), coarse and fine
matches, loops closed, CorrectPoses and its Ceres Compute; a separate record per map
regeneration. Buffered in memory, written every 1000 records and at exit. Off (no clock
read) unless FORKLIFT_SLAM_TRACE names a file. The Mapper constructor prints
'forklift_slam_patch series=<id> trace=<0|1>' once.
